| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| UI/logs show port `0` after start | Archive returned ctor arg, not kernel-assigned port | After `bind`, expose `boundPort = serverSocket.localPort`; persist for system-proxy write (T06) |

