### `zts_node_stop SIGABRT (detach while running)`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| `Fatal signal 6` in `zts_node_stop`, abort "attempting to detach while still running code", thread `libzt-node` | libzt JNI wrapper calls `jvm->DetachCurrentThread()` on the **calling** thread; Java-managed threads with live frames abort ART | Patched in-tree: removed `java_detach_from_thread()` from `zts_node_stop`/`zts_node_free` in `libzt/src/bindings/java/JavaSockets.cxx`. Never call stop/free expecting the wrapper to detach a Java thread |

