| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| `zts_node_start failed: -2` after quick stop→start or double `ACTION_START` | Native node state is process-global; node still running (`ZTS_ERR_SERVICE`) | Treat `-2` as already-running success in `ZeroTierNodeManager.start`; serialize `startProxy`/`stopProxy` with `startStopMutex` in `ProxyModeService` |

